": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75210393_852485259855759_6019629505745872437_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5oozmYGZcAQQ7kNvwH6t_6l&_nc_oc=AdqZXg5LdtC64Ducy5Je3KxxSG15x77XW2S8Jqgjc_R_vOiA-vc0zMEKD-z1B8SWzdc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHsAwlkCD5HMPgPj--tSl7t41uge2F-mCXW_OwXNLAnPw&oe=6A75CA5B"}, {"file_name": "sc1.png", "id": "1698965373936946", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982551_1698965377270279_7553645442698234559_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3O4cm2LbVV4Q7kNvwESPLy7&_nc_oc=AdrjmIGm8VFR5WMoxvh8HwZaxcx1BULhsYpoPeGgyvgm7spEqM0pdajPPlVuUTwF25g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFRJG-bCeHpWuSqL4UKDNiBKSxNdK6MBV2jCoCpU42v7w&oe=6A75F2E1"}, {"file_name": "sc3.png", "id": "362227642863079", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75312297_362227646196412_4627867009706605201_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gQ2iKdkEBwgQ7kNvwGe5ChA&_nc_oc=Adq8wtwYbAddNp0dwskJAdN62qSnyAkcpvG4r7QzOSVQVD-wMVBlPVzcf0yNIq9hx4U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQF4d_V2KPTwunG7gSaECAEB_nKNWu3b-GrVBi3805436g&oe=6A75DFAF"}, {"file_name": "sc5.png", "id": "167386486400512", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982562_167386489733845_2832025039911865533_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gi2TQ_Ha-XcQ7kNvwEAdytm&_nc_oc=AdpKgRoT0_GDjOqFtYJbyqeNnm9YcqACF_pLD93cwhmm-y0OBm3DRAQV8SYAQpj5MSc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFVBmRUDrzAgmxGDrB9q3mv09SVaQlq82xJxs6HzWn4Yg&oe=6A75DF52"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "sc4.png", "id": "860094495571873", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75240101_860094502238539_6759068810652291731_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xuFrT1wx77QQ7kNvwG_8Qey&_nc_oc=Adqg2R8Kv4aoWlDK1wWmz2TPIeUjSMGZ24cqsIW8fqDO38ANmMckCSRX4lLx7CPc2Kc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEIJjhqIge3zIhOLPK4ok2UOmOztT3ZeYlksAhFh70ZxA&oe=6A75E8FD"}, "display_name": "Ball smasher", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Ball smasher aims at stress reduction. \n\nGrab any of the weapons: boxing gloves, baseball bat, sledgehammer, shovel, cricket bat, tennis bat, or your fists and smash some balls. \n\nThis unconventional method provides a physical outlet for pent-up tension, allowing individuals to release stress in a controlled environment. The variety of available tools caters to different preferences, ensuring a personalized experience. \n\nWhether you prefer the satisfying thud of a baseball bat connecting with a ball or the raw power of using your fists, the ball smasher offers a unique and cathartic way to let off steam. \n\nIt transforms the act of stress relief into a physical and engaging activity. So, the next time stress looms, head to the ball smasher and unleash your frustration on those unsuspecting balls. It's not just a stress reliever; it's a fun and dynamic approach to coping with life's pressures, promoting a healthier and more balanced mindset. \n\nTake a swing, make a hit, and feel the tension melt away as you engage in this unconventional yet effective stress-busting activity.", "short_description": "Ball smasher aims at stress reduction. \n\nGrab any of the weapons: boxing gloves, baseball bat, sledgehammer, shovel, cricket bat, tennis bat, or your fists and smash some balls. \n\nThis unconventional method provides a physical outlet for pent-up tension, allowing individuals to release stress in a controlled environment. The variety of available tools caters to different preferences, ensuring a personalized experience. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://artisoft.pl/policies/bs_v1.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Artisoft", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://bs.a